  <item>
    <title>Vol.53｜恋爱1周年！充盈的爱，滋养我们成为更幸福的人</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/699033e8de29766da9911f58</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">699033e8de29766da9911f58</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 14 Feb 2026 13:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>🌟 2月14日，准时出现！今天是情人节，同时也是我跟凯凯在恋爱一周年的日子。借由这个可爱的机会，我把凯凯邀请来边边角角，一起聊聊爱情。我们分享了彼此相识、相知、相恋的故事，聊了聊我们吵架的磨合日常；也探讨了爱的本质与我们的未来，分享了交往一周年的体会。这是一期甜甜的轻松播客，邀请你来听！</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎁 祝边边角角的所有听众情人节快乐，愿大家都能找到能让自己更快乐的另一半 💓✨</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🎙️ 本期嘉宾：</span></strong><span>凯凯、温心</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>&gt;&gt;&gt; 本期你将听到：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【聊聊相处日常】</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="150">02:30</a> 明明是同事，怎么就变成恋人了！</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="653">10:53</a> 选择另一半，就是选择了另外一半的自己</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1023">17:03</a> 价值观测试题：如果突然有了一笔巨款，你们分别打算做什么？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1322">22:02</a> 吵架后，一般谁来低头？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1332">22:12</a> 亲密关系里，冷战和吵架哪个更伤感情？</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>【聊聊爱与未来】</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1645">27:25</a> 理想的亲密关系：信任、支持、自由</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2166">36:06</a> 长大后，我们一点一点学习如何去“爱”</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2507">41:47</a> “成年人只筛选不改变”，你认同吗？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2594">43:14</a> 小遗憾：我们的未来，如何重叠到一起</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>【一周年小感悟】</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2849">47:29</a> 足够自爱，爱才能流向别人</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2930">48:50</a> 爱全部的他，爱完整的他</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2985">49:45</a> “期待是一种隐形的暴力”</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3026">50:26</a> 一起设立一个共同的小目标吧！</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="30686">511:26</a> Happy Wife! Happy Life!! :)</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>&gt;&gt;&gt; BGM：</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>How Long Will I Love You - Ellie Goulding</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>The Luckiest - Ben Folds</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fhj_znVhVXrQKqj6kDGxG34zkTXH.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>2025年10月，摄于法国埃菲尔铁塔下。</span></blockquote>]]></description>
